sequenceDiagram
  participant Buyer as W4 buyer
  participant Signer as Signer :8787
  participant Server as Redeem :8793
  participant Ledger as XRPL Testnet
  Buyer->>Server: request challenge
  Server-->>Buyer: nonce and expiry
  Buyer->>Signer: POST /sign-challenge
  Signer-->>Buyer: signature, not a transaction
  Buyer->>Server: redeem with signature
  Server->>Server: match key to account or regular key
  Server->>Server: consume nonce before holder check
  Server->>Ledger: account_nfts
  Ledger-->>Server: holder, issuer, taxon, URI
  Server->>Server: uses remain and not expired
  Server->>Server: deliver job and write lab receipt
  Note over Server: 401 signature · 409 replay or used up<br/>403 wrong holder · 400 expired
